re all connected through J4 Hub, each one has its own purpose, functionality, and design. I made the individual scripts separately and then added them into J4 Hub so they could all be accessed from one place.\nJ4 Hub itself is also part of my project. I created the interface, the buttons, the tabs, the animations, the player settings, the credits section, the scrolling Scripts tab, and the overall design of the hub.\nThe idea behind J4 Hub is simple:\nOne hub. Multiple scripts. One creator.\nInstead of having to use a bunch of separate GUIs, J4 Hub brings everything together into one organized interface. As the hub continues to grow, I can continue creating new scripts and adding more features to it.\nEvery script inside the hub is something I made myself, and each one can be updated or improved individually while still being part of the larger J4 Hub project.\nSo, to summarize:\nJ4 Hub is independent.\nEvery script inside it was made by me.\nEach script was created individually.\nThe hub brings all of my scripts together in one place.\nAnd the entire project is made by J4KEISCOOLER.\nThank you for checking out J4 Hub, and remember:\nOne creator. One hub. Multiple scripts.\nJ4 Hub — Made by J4KEISCOOLER","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6a5350c2054d92b84b720947","username":"J4KEISCOOLER","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0d144594644592a1681939d6b944a16932656a521739b1c4beccb36a6be5c6b9.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a5350c2054d92b84b720947-1783845108900.png"},"status":"offline","id":"6a5350c2054d92b84b720947","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0d144594644592a1681939d6b944a16932656a521739b1c4beccb36a6be5c6b9.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a5350c2054d92b84b720947-1783845108900.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0